PODFoam llm_demo/hpc: the GPU path

These scripts run the asynchronous suite with Gemma 4 12B on a Slurm GPU node.
setup_12b.sh fetches the pinned weights and llama.cpp and checks their SHA-256.
build_llama_cuda.sh builds llama.cpp where the prebuilt binaries need a newer
glibc. start_server.sh and stop_server.sh run the server and check that the
pid they handle is a llama-server. async_v2.slurm runs the suite with OpenFOAM
in an Apptainer image. Site settings come from the environment. The runtime
lives beside the repository and the job output under llm_demo/, which its
.gitignore covers.

